Package: cowsec
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OryxAstro <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), systemd, ca-certificates, gnupg, curl, iproute2, iptables
Recommends: docker-ce | docker.io
Homepage: https://github.com/OryxAstro/cowsec
Description: Web console and installer for CrowdSec on mailcow-dockerized
 CowSec installs and manages CrowdSec on a mailcow server: firewall bouncer for
 host and Docker-published mail ports, an OpenResty edge with the CrowdSec
 bouncer and AppSec WAF, DNS-01 certificates (190+ DNS providers via lego),
 a ban policy with home countries and escalating bans, and a browser console
 with 2FA sign-in.
